<li id="bib.bib21" class="ltx_bibitem"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_role_refnum ltx_tag_bibitem">Li et al. (2025b)</span>
<span class="ltx_bibblock">
Zhong-Zhi Li, Duzhen Zhang, Ming-Liang Zhang, Jiaxin Zhang, Zengyan Liu, Yuxuan Yao, Haotian Xu, Junhao Zheng, Pei-Jie Wang, Xiuyi Chen, Yingying Zhang, Fei Yin, Jiahua Dong, Zhijiang Guo, Le Song, and Cheng-Lin Liu.

